{"term":{"iri":"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0000393","compactId":"SO_0000393","id":"SO:0000393","label":"U4_snRNA","definition":{"text":"U4 small nuclear RNA (U4 snRNA) is a component of the major U2-dependent spliceosome. It forms a duplex with U6, and with each splicing round, it is displaced from U6 (and the spliceosome) in an ATP-dependent manner, allowing U6 to refold and create the active site for splicing catalysis. A recycling process involving protein Prp24 re-anneals U4 and U6.","xrefs":["http://www.sanger.ac.uk/cgi-bin/Rfam/getacc?RF00015"]},"comments":[],"synonyms":[{"scope":"exact","value":"U4 small nuclear RNA"},{"scope":"exact","value":"U4 snRNA"},{"scope":"exact","value":"small nuclear RNA U4"},{"scope":"exact","value":"snRNA U4"}],"xrefs":["http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/U4_snRNA"],"subsets":["SOFA"],"altIds":[],"namespace":"sequence","isObsolete":false,"replacedBy":[],"canonicalUrl":"/browser/current_release/term/SO:0000393/","history":{"firstSeen":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]},"mostRecent":{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]},"entries":[{"hash":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","date":"2016-12-05","subject":"Add renamed SO files","issueRefs":[]}],"semanticEvents":[{"type":"created","date":"2016-12-05","commit":"92e3cae9f3d39e5979110bad332c5fadf7a4b3ab","shortHash":"92e3cae","subject":"Add renamed SO files","summary":"Term introduced into the editable ontology history","details":["Initial label: U4_snRNA","Initial definition captured.","Initial parent: SO:0000274"],"issueRefs":[]}]},"parents":["SO:0000274"],"children":[],"ancestors":["SO:0000274","SO:0002247","SO:0000655","SO:0000233","SO:0000673","SO:0000831","SO:0001411","SO:0000001","SO:0000110"],"descendants":[],"relationships":[],"graphNeighborho